  "_comment": "Form definitions and where they go. Every form and both popups post to ONE n8n workflow (Mārketinga Skola - mājaslapas pieteikumi, uSmnXxiT4rUcVAGj). It saves the enquiry in the n8n data table Mājaslapas pieteikumi, answers the browser, e-mails Rihards and, for the two LIAA forms only, sends a fixed reply. MailerLite took the leads until 14 Sep 2026, while the site had no server of its own. The path is still liaa-lead because the LIAA form used it first, and keeping it meant no gap while the workflow and the site were updated separately. The key in the URL is obfuscation, not authentication: it ships in client JS and only stops drive-by noise. See CLAUDE.md.",
